    {
      "caption": "A complex number is a point on the Argand diagram",
      "duration_ms": 8000,
      "id": "s1",
      "narration": "A complex number is a point on the Argand diagram. The real part goes across the horizontal axis, the imaginary part goes up the vertical axis. The number z equals 3 plus 2i sits 3 across and 2 up from the origin.",
